        "exact_bytes_digest": "fa5f222891ac9f1ffb213bc91dedef350e052322c5554b6b9067eea159a8ddbb",
        "exact_text": "During the Continuation Period, Parent shall, or shall cause the Company and its Subsidiaries to, provide Continuing Employees whose employment is terminated (in a manner that would trigger severance benefits) with severance benefits in accordance with such employee’s individual employment agreement or severance agreement or, in the absence of any such agreement, in accordance with the applicable severance policy of the Company or its Subsidiaries in effect immediately prior to the Closing, in each case, subject to any requirements therein (e.g., the execution of a release of claims).",
